      "sourceTextSha256": "6df78ac15c2f0feba3ca45ab04fd32f1ea978fd1c934ed1679ff3e509538115d",
      "text": "Day 3 · After breakfast, an excursion (4 hours) to Corcovado. A train climbs from the foot of the mountain through the Tijuca rainforest, where you may encounter some of Rio’s tropical wildlife, such as toucans and monkeys. At the summit, 710 metres above sea level, stands the iconic 38-metre statue of Christ the Redeemer, with breathtaking panoramas from Guanabara Bay and Maracanã Stadium to Sugar Loaf, Copacabana, Ipanema and Gávea Mountain. After the tour, enjoy coffee and traditional Brazilian sweets at the historic Confeitaria Colombo.",
